<title>NETHERLANDS: Milumil sold only in Britain - Nutricia.</title>
<headline>Milumil sold only in Britain - Nutricia.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch food group Nutricia NV said on Friday its Milumil baby milk powder, which it is recalling, is made exclusively for the British market and is not sold in any other country.</p>
<p>&quot;The product...represents only a small part of our total sales in this market,&quot; Nutricia said in a statement.</p>
<p>Nutricia unit Milupa has withdrawn Milumil after fears of a possible association between the product and salmonella.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no conclusive proof and we understand that the (British) Department of Health has not tested any of our products,&quot; Nutricia said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
